Package: shiye
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yuii <yuii@localhost>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd
Description: RSS, Atom and read-later reading inbox for TOS 7
 Shiye is a self-hosted reading inbox that runs entirely on the NAS.
 It reads RSS 2.0, RSS 1.0 and Atom 1.0, and can also save any web page
 for later with server-side article extraction. It supports categories,
 OPML import and export, unread and starred states, full-text search,
 scheduled refresh with conditional HTTP requests, and a keyboard-friendly
 three-pane interface with a focused reading view.
 .
 Feeds and saved pages are fetched over HTTP(S) by the application user.
 Article HTML is sanitized on the server before it is stored, remote
 images are proxied, and tracking parameters are removed from links.
